{"4121260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Solid Void Art Nonograms", "steam_appid": 4121260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover beautiful art hidden in nonograms!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/d87d038e34b346c6c7e3a508fb685750.poster.avif?t=1764316940\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/d87d038e34b346c6c7e3a508fb685750.webm?t=1764316940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/d87d038e34b346c6c7e3a508fb685750.mp4?t=1764316940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Solid Void</strong> is a nonogram game that combines griddlers with pentonimo-like puzzles. Get confronted with increasingly difficult levels and uncover the art of great historical artists like Van Gogh or Vermeer. All of that is a great excuse to exercise your brain a bit!<br><br>Nonograms, also known as Japanese Crosswords or Picross, tend to be one of the most relaxing and cozy puzzle games. If you are looking for relaxing but challenging entertainment and if you love classics of painting, Solid Void will be right up your alley.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >11 marvellous pieces of art to uncover</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/49b9afe4a5013a84ab403f097e0b1ab4.poster.avif?t=1764316940\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/49b9afe4a5013a84ab403f097e0b1ab4.webm?t=1764316940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/49b9afe4a5013a84ab403f097e0b1ab4.mp4?t=1764316940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Da Vinci, Van Gogh, Munch... We chose 11 legendary paintings from across various ages and art styles. This way of looking at art is groundbreaking, as you can analyse it bit by bit - it will take you a while to uncover everything!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >176 levels - something nice for everyone!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/0cf9bf8565e50fe94db0464b8d8077cb.poster.avif?t=1764316940\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/0cf9bf8565e50fe94db0464b8d8077cb.webm?t=1764316940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/0cf9bf8565e50fe94db0464b8d8077cb.mp4?t=1764316940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Solid Void will last you for quite a while. The game has 176 levels. It starts with easy ones and progresses to the more challenging ones. So, whether you are a nonogram newbie or a veteran, you’ll find something enjoyable for yourself!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It’s good for ya!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/59249c23ece542563ce7212ddbb0b1a7.poster.avif?t=1764316940\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/59249c23ece542563ce7212ddbb0b1a7.webm?t=1764316940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/59249c23ece542563ce7212ddbb0b1a7.mp4?t=1764316940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Nonograms are considered proper brain workouts. They have been linked to increased cognitive functions like memory and brain agility. The brain’s a bit like a muscle - it works best if you train it!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 176 levels to beat.<br></li><li> 11 classic art pieces to uncover.<br></li><li> Nonogram meets pentonimo.<br></li><li> Great for brain exercise.<br></li><li> For both newbies and veterans of puzzles.</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover beautiful art hidden in nonograms!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/d87d038e34b346c6c7e3a508fb685750.poster.avif?t=1764316940\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/d87d038e34b346c6c7e3a508fb685750.webm?t=1764316940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/d87d038e34b346c6c7e3a508fb685750.mp4?t=1764316940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Solid Void</strong> is a nonogram game that combines griddlers with pentonimo-like puzzles. Get confronted with increasingly difficult levels and uncover the art of great historical artists like Van Gogh or Vermeer. All of that is a great excuse to exercise your brain a bit!<br><br>Nonograms, also known as Japanese Crosswords or Picross, tend to be one of the most relaxing and cozy puzzle games. If you are looking for relaxing but challenging entertainment and if you love classics of painting, Solid Void will be right up your alley.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >11 marvellous pieces of art to uncover</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/49b9afe4a5013a84ab403f097e0b1ab4.poster.avif?t=1764316940\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/49b9afe4a5013a84ab403f097e0b1ab4.webm?t=1764316940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/49b9afe4a5013a84ab403f097e0b1ab4.mp4?t=1764316940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Da Vinci, Van Gogh, Munch... We chose 11 legendary paintings from across various ages and art styles. This way of looking at art is groundbreaking, as you can analyse it bit by bit - it will take you a while to uncover everything!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >176 levels - something nice for everyone!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/0cf9bf8565e50fe94db0464b8d8077cb.poster.avif?t=1764316940\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/0cf9bf8565e50fe94db0464b8d8077cb.webm?t=1764316940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/0cf9bf8565e50fe94db0464b8d8077cb.mp4?t=1764316940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Solid Void will last you for quite a while. The game has 176 levels. It starts with easy ones and progresses to the more challenging ones. So, whether you are a nonogram newbie or a veteran, you’ll find something enjoyable for yourself!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It’s good for ya!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/59249c23ece542563ce7212ddbb0b1a7.poster.avif?t=1764316940\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121260/extras/59249c23ece542563ce7212ddbb0b1a7.webm